    <name>Bandung - Lembang - Tangkuban Perahu</name>
    <desc>This route leaves the city and climbs steadily through plantations, then follows a ridge with three short descents and a long exposed section before the final run into town. This route leaves the city and climbs steadily through plantations, then follows a ridge with three short descents and a long exposed section before the final run into town. More notes at https://example.com/notes/west-java and ignore javascript:alert(1).</desc>
